 crates/victory-gpu/src/host.rs    | 74 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 crates/victory-gpu/src/memtel.rs  | 55 ++++++++++++++++++++---
 crates/victory-gpu/src/ramline.rs |  3 ++
 3 files changed, 123 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

